WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:01.547
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.497 --> 00:00:06.141
Twenty stands to open, and Maya presses twenty buttons, one by one!

3
00:00:06.141 --> 00:00:08.409
Her finger is so tired!

4
00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:11.700
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.205
This is Episode 69.

6
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:16.047
Meet the whisper tube.

7
00:00:16.047 --> 00:00:18.813
The whisper tube has no buttons at all.

8
00:00:18.813 --> 00:00:21.438
Maya just whispers what she wants.

9
00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.232
Open the whole row!

10
00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:24.479
Whoosh!

11
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:27.211
Twenty stands open at the same moment.

12
00:00:27.211 --> 00:00:29.230
And the tube remembers.

13
00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:32.603
Tomorrow morning, Maya whispers the same words.

14
00:00:32.603 --> 00:00:36.345
Same stands, same result, every single time.

15
00:00:36.345 --> 00:00:40.288
The tube can even reach the far-away towns, in one breath.

16
00:00:40.288 --> 00:00:42.781
Buttons are great for one stand.

17
00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:45.063
Whispers are great for many.

18
00:00:45.063 --> 00:00:47.747
That is the AWS CLI.

19
00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:51.963
You type a few short words, and AWS does all the work.

20
00:00:51.963 --> 00:00:54.089
Now you know the whisper tube!

21
00:00:54.089 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

